@@text From 2026-11-07 23:01 Tempad is its own jar (`backportedTempad-3.0.4-ce-19.2-01.jar` in `mods/`, no longer nested in `creativecompat-1.0.0.jar`); rows not yet run target that jar. SQ-TP-40 (not run): full pack boots with both jars, `tempad` and `creativecompat` both listed, no duplicate-mod error; Common + Compat alone (no Tempad jar, no `tempad_upstream/`) boots clean (with CQ-CCB-03).
@@text
