@@text lines that stopped 1.19.2 loading the rest of `tempad_static` lang). Same setup as SQ-TP-01 (donor jar in
@@text `tempad_upstream/`, no `tempad-forge-*.jar`). Rows 21 to 25 / CQ-TP-12 to -14 check the fixes; 26 to 30 / CQ-TP-15 fill the
@@text gaps left by the phase rows above, so SQ-TP-01..30 plus CQ-TP-01..15 cover the whole mod. A FAIL in rows 1 to 20 that
@@text rows 21 to 25 also touch: check it against the fix first (door offsets, messages, momentum, markers, number boxes).
