## SQ-TP-42 | two chronometers charge the Tempad: the first one found charges, the second is ignored (A4)
@group A
@commands Bot `t42` with a Tempad at 0 chronons in hotbar 0 and two chronometers at 0 in hotbar 1 and 2; `cdevtest tickwarp 2400`; `/ztp chr t42`
@pass the Tempad has chronons after the warp (it was 0 with two chronometers before the fix); the hotbar 2 chronometer still holds 0 (ignored, and `auto_charge_blacklist` keeps it from being charged)
@fails Tempad still 0: `ChronometerItem.isClashing` still stops both (each sees the other in `tempad:chronon_generators`); hotbar 2 above 0: the second chronometer charges itself (first-found check wrong) or is charged by the first (tag missing from the donor)
@draft no batch holds this row yet
