@commands Place a Timedoor Marker, name it `Home` and pick a color, close; reopen the screen and look before clicking anything; click the color square, pick another color, close the picker
@pass on reopen the name box shows `Home` and the color box the saved `#RRGGBB` without a click; after the picker closes the color box shows the new color's hex, and closing the screen saves that color (reopen to check)
